### Anything else?

When running `docker image list` before and after the second `docker compose up --detach --build` run, I can see that the image ID changes. Despite that, the second `docker compose up --detach --build` does not restart the container. When running `docker compose --ansi never --progress json up --detach --build` to see what exactly is happening, I get something like:
